SOLUTION 1 Pure water 100C pH 3
    temp 100
    pH 3 charge
    pe 4
    redox pe
    units mol/kgw
    density 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    K-mica 0 10
    Kaolinite 0 10
    Dolomite 0 10
    Epsomite 0 10
    Fe(OH)3(a) 0 10
    Halite 0 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.out
    -reset false
    -user_punch true
USER_PUNCH
    -headings sc
    10 PUNCH SC